import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Maintenance">
  <h1>Maintenance</h1>
  <p>This section collects the recurring service plan, fluid references, tire information, and owner maintenance records for the 2021 S60 range. Individual engine, drivetrain, brake, and market differences are called out where they affect service.</p>
  <h2>Maintenance pages</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><a href="./service-schedule/">Service schedule</a></li>
    <li><a href="./fluids/">Fluids and capacities</a></li>
    <li><a href="./tires-wheels/">Tires and wheels</a></li>
    <li><a href="./log/">Maintenance and repair log</a></li>
    <li><a href="./owner-checks/">Owner maintenance checks</a></li>
  </ul>
  <h2>Record every service</h2>
  <p>Keep the date, odometer, work performed, parts and fluid specifications, invoice, and next due point. For AWD-related work, record the component serviced and the exact fluid specification.</p>
  <div class="note">Use the vehicle's VIN-specific maintenance schedule and labels. Similar model years, engines, and option packages may use different parts or procedures.</div>
</BaseLayout>
